#   "lays out a toggle-group control whose un-pressed value is INHERIT"
#   (the control's `defaultOptionValue` is now DISABLED, so the INHERIT
#   assertion flips).
# Mutation: `useSetConsolidationUischema` sets `defaultOptionValue` to
#   `InvoiceConsolidationTypes.DISABLED` instead of `INHERIT`.
#
# Apply with:  git apply <this file>   (run from repo root)
# Revert with: git apply -R <this file>
diff --git a/packages/headless/src/modules/contract-product/contract-product.schemas.ts b/packages/headless/src/modules/contract-product/contract-product.schemas.ts
index dbf29fa61..6b706d239 100644
